*.tif  binary
*.psd  binary
*.ogg  binary
*.wav  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.flac binary
*.flp  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.fbx  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.xlsx binary
